        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-10-20T18:39:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Grats to Christopher on the new house. :) My best friend got a new house last year, and it continues to bring him joy and comfort.</p>\n<p>Sentinels vampires are allergic to birds. It's just canon!</p>\n<p>Whatever did Harpy do to deserve all this dunking? :3</p>\n<p>So what I'm getting from the answer to my letter is The Court of Blood means family. :V</p>\n<p>Solid Weird Al reference at the end! :D</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:09:55.444Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
