        "user_title": "",
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Grats to Christopher on the new house. :) My best friend got a new house last year, and it continues to bring him joy and comfort.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Sentinels vampires are allergic to birds. It's just canon!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whatever did Harpy do to deserve all this dunking? :3</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So what I'm getting from the answer to my letter is The Court of Blood means family. :V</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Solid Weird Al reference at the end! :D</p>",
